      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This is an intentional change that is required for face tracking on mobile and future changes on other platforms.\n\nWe know it may have some effect on existing content until creators update their worlds, but there isn't a good way around that at the moment.\n\nAs such, while we do acknowledge the bug, we will be closing this ticket for now as it won't be further changed from our side.\n\nAs a workaround, you can scale your avatar larger for now, until a world update potentially fixes it for small scales as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
